SUMMARY:Haunted Trolley Tours
DESCRIPTION:Discover history\, mystery\, and lore with your ghost host on the Haunted Trolley\, if you dare\, for a special late-night tour of downtown Raleigh’s most haunted places. Jump aboard and keep your eyes open for ghostly visitors of years past… they’ve just been dying to have you. \nRecommended for ages 6 and up due to frightening elements. Tours go out at 7:00\, 8:00\, and 9:00 pm\, and the trolley departs from Mordecai Historic Park. Tickets are $15. Advanced registration is recommended. Please call 919-996-4364 for more information.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/haunted-trolley-tours/2026-10-16/
LOCATION:Mordecai Historic Park\, 1 Mimosa Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27604\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Mordecai_Haunted-Trolley-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
